Negative control for filter-i18n.test.ts.

Points the tri-state's `true` position at a key no catalogue carries, so the
option-label channel (§13.3's renderer-internal lookup) resolves to the raw key.

The `verified` and `bounced` columns declare byte-identical `oneOf` blocks, so
the hunk carries eight lines of leading context down from `verified: {` — its
`title: "text.verified_label"` line is the only thing that stops git landing
this mutation on `bounced`, where filter-i18n.test.ts never looks.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

